{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32865","headline":"投京兆府试官任文学先辈 · 李频","name":"投京兆府试官任文学先辈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高兴每论诗，非才独见推。\n应当明试日，不比暗投时。\n出口人皆信，操心自可知。\n孤单虽有托，际会别无期。\n取舍知由己，穷通断在兹。\n贱身何足数，公道自难欺。\n泽国违甘旨，渔舟积梦思。\n长安未归去，爲倚鉴妍媸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李频","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32865.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32865","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}